        "summary": "Create a webhook endpoint",
        "description": "Starts sending your workspace's events to an https URL: every type by default (`[\"*\"]`, including types added later), or the ones you list. Runs started from the API, the studio and MCP all send events. The answer holds the endpoint's signing secret, shown only here and when you rotate it. A workspace can have up to 16 endpoints; one more answers `409`.\n\nNeeds an API key with the `generations:write` scope.",
