    "/v1/files": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "uploadFile",
        "summary": "Upload an image",
        "description": "Stores an image you send as the request body, with no multipart encoding: `curl --data-binary @photo.jpg`. PNG, JPEG or WebP, up to 4 MB; the type is read from the bytes. Pass the returned ID in a model's input. Send videos and sounds through `POST /v1/uploads` instead.\n\nNeeds an API key with the `generations:write` scope.",
